Package: ar0234-camera
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: zyi <2971385581@qq.com>
Depends: linux-image-current-sun60iw2, linux-dtb-current-sun60iw2
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: AR0234 global-shutter camera support for Orange Pi Zero 3W (A733)
 libisp 3A daemon (ar0234-3ad), VE hardware recorder (ar0234-rec), NPU
 zero-copy tool, udev rules, device tree update via fdtput, and first-pass
 ISP tuning parameters. The sensor driver and the patched vin framework are
 part of the kernel package (orangepi-build userpatches/kernel/sun60iw2-current).
